#: code:addons/account_prevent_draft/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Invoice %(name)s cannot be reset to draft because it was authorized by ARCA "
"through a web service (CAE %(cae)s). It must be cancelled with a credit note."
msgstr ""
"No se puede pasar a borrador la factura %(name)s porque fue autorizada por "
"ARCA mediante web service (CAE %(cae)s). Debe anularse mediante una nota de "
"crédito."
